    "chunk_text": "Her ongyn\u00f0 seo \u00f0ridde boc, \u00f0e is genemned on Ebreis Uaiccra, & Leuiticus on Grecisc, & Ministerialis Drihten clypode to Moyse on \u00fe\u00e6re halgan wur\u00feungstowe, & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Sege Israhela bearnum: Gyf & sette his hand ofer \u00fe\u00e6re offrunge heafod: \u00feonne bi\u00fe heo andfenge & fremiende to his cl\u00e6nsunge. Ofrie \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t cealf beforan Drihtne, & Aarones suna, \u00fe\u00e6s sacerdes, offrian \u00fe\u00e6s cealfes blod & & hyldon \u00fea offrunga & ceorfan to sticcon. & don fyr innan \u00fe\u00e6t weofod uppan \u00feam sticceom \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6r tosnidene beo\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t heafod & ealle \u00f0a \u00feingc & waxan \u00fe\u00e6t innewearde & \u00fea fet; & se sacerd forb\u00e6rne \u00f0a Drihtne to leohte & to wynsumum stence. Gyf seo offrung \u00feonne beo of sceapon o\u00f0\u00f0e of gaton, bringe enytre offrunga & unwemme. & offrie \u00f0a beforan Drihtne \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s weofodes sidan \u00fee is on nor\u00fehealfe, & geoton Aarones suna \u00fe\u00e6t & tod\u00e6lon \u00fea lima & \u00fe\u00e6t heafod & ealle \u00fea \u00feingc \u00fee on \u00fe\u00e6re lifre clifia\u00f0, & lecgon uppan \u00feone wudu Waxan \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t innewearde: & se sacerd b\u00e6rn\u00fe hit eall uppon \u00f0am weofode to wynsumum Gyf seo offrung \u00feonne bi\u00fe of fugelum, \u00feonne bringe he turtlan & culfran briddas, & offrie se sacerd & wurpe \u00feone cropp & \u00fea fe\u00feera wi\u00f0\u00e6ftan \u00fe\u00e6t weof",
